"The Libra is Aulia Velra's megayacht, which her grandson Lute calls her lair."
"Lute Velra lived aboard the Libra before moving out on his own."
"A Rabbit with Tailor Environment keeps the Libra arranged for Aulia."
"The Libra docks at North Point Marina."
"It has a glass-bottomed pool over a sitting room and a retractable lit roof."
"Its numbered cabins include one kept by Orpheus Velra; a piano was aboard for Lute."
"Its staff include Chef Kabir, a stewardess who makes beds without hands, and hull crew."
